<translation id="22791603784558743">Vala iGemini kuUltimatum Dev</translation>
<translation id="2284380654876659752">Uma uvakashela isayithi, iUltimatum ithumela ingxenye eyi-obfuscation ye-URL kokuthi <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Ukubhrawuza ngokuphephile kweGoogle<ph name="END_LINK" /> isebenzisa iseva yangasese efihla ikheli lakho lasesizindeni se-inthanethi. Uma isayithi ingakusekeli okuthile okusolisayo, kuzothunyelwa wonke ama-URL kanye nekhontenti encane yekhasi.</translation>
<translation id="2290014774651636340">Okhiye be-Google API abekho. Okunye ukusebenza kwe-Ultimatum kuzokhutshazwa.</translation>
<translation id="2290095356545025170">Ingabe uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukukhipha i-Ultimatum?</translation>
<translation id="2301513536169703857">Ukuze uthole amaphasiwedi akho, amabhukhimakhi, nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuUltimatum.</translation>
<translation id="2307973900865360088">Kugcine Edokhini</translation>
<translation id="2309047409763057870">Lokhu ukufakwa kwesibili kwe-Ultimatum, futhi akukwazi ukwenziwa isiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo.</translation>
<translation id="2345992953227471816">I-Ultimatum ithole ukuthi lezi zandiso zinohlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha:</translation>
<translation id="2348335408836342058">I-Ultimatum idinga imvume ukuze ifinyelele kukhamera yakho nemakrofoni yaleli sayithi</translation>
<translation id="234869673307233423">I-Ultimatum ayikwazi ukuhlola amaphasiwedi akho. Zama futhi emuva kwesikhathi.</translation>
<translation id="2359808026110333948">Qhubeka</translation>
<translation id="2403703063067034158">Iphutha lokuqala: esinye isenzakalo sokusetha siyaqalisa okwamanje, sicela uzame futhi ngokuhamba kwesikhathi.</translation>
<translation id="2409816192575564775">{NUM_DEVICES,plural, =0{Idivayisi e-1 ye-HID ibifinyelelwa yisandiso se-Ultimatum esisodwa noma eziningi}=1{Idivayisi e-1 ye-HID ifinyelelwa yisandiso se-Ultimatum esisodwa noma eziningi}one{Amadivayisi angu-# e-HID abefinyelelwa yisandiso se-Ultimatum esisodwa noma eziningi}other{Amadivayisi angu-# e-HID abefinyelelwa yisandiso se-Ultimatum esisodwa noma eziningi}}</translation>
<translation id="2424440923901031101">Lesi sandiso sephula inqubomgomo Yesitolo sewebu se-Ultimatum, futhi kungenzeka singabi esiphephile. Sisuse ku-Ultimatum ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="2467438592969358367">I-Ultimatum ifuna ukuthumela amaphasiwedi akho. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="2472092250898121027">Lesi sandiso sinohlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha futhi asiphephile. Sisuse ku-Ultimatum ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="2485422356828889247">Khipha</translation>
<translation id="2513154137948333830">Ukuqalisa kuyadingeka: <ph name="INSTALL_SUCCESS" /></translation>
<translation id="2534365042754120737">Ukuvikela idatha lakho vumela i-Ultimatum isuse izimvume kumasayithi ongakawavakasheli muva nje. Ayizimisi izaziso.</translation>
<translation id="2556847002339236023">Inhlangano yakho ivala i-Ultimatum uma ingasetshenziswa isikhathi eingu-<ph name="TIMEOUT_DURATION" />. Idatha yokubhrawuza isuliwe. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda.</translation>
<translation id="2563121210305478421">Qalisa kabusha i-Ultimatum?</translation>
<translation id="2569974318947988067">I-Ultimatum izozama ukuthuthukisa ukufuna ukuya ku-HTTPS</translation>
<translation id="2571392474191184472">Inhlangano yakho iphatha iUltimatum</translation>
<translation id="2574930892358684005">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usengenile ngemvume kakade kule phrofayela ye-Ultimatum. Ukuze uqhubeke nokuphequlula ngokwehlukile, i-Ultimatum ingakwazi ukukudalela iphrofayela yakho.</translation>
<translation id="2580411288591421699">Ayikwazi ukufaka inguqulo ye-Ultimatum efana nalena esebenza manje. Sicela uvale i-Ultimatum uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="2586406160782125153">Lokhu kuzosusa idatha yakho yokuphequlula kusukela kule divayisi. Ukuze uthole idatha yakho emuva kwesikhathi, ngena ngemvume ku-Ultimatum njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" />.</translation>
