<translation id="263447411082773721">Gcina amaphasiwedi akho, amabhukhimakhi, nomlando kuvunyelaniswe ngokuphelele kuwo wonke amadivayisi. Finyelela kalula izakhi ozaziyo nozithandayo ngokubuyekeza ibhrawuza yakho ezenzakalelayo ibe yiUltimatum. IUltimatum izophinwa kutaskbar yakho ukuze ifinyeleleke ngokushesha.</translation>
