<translation id="408393047846373801">Ukuze uthole amaphasiwedi akho kanye nokwengeziwe kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuUltimatum. Le phasiwedi izolondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho ngemva kokungena ngemvume.</translation>
