<translation id="5468572406162360320">Ukusiza ukuthuthukisa lezi zakhi, i-Ultimatum ithumela ukusebenzisana kwakho nazo ku-Google. Le datha ingase ifundwe, icutshungulwe, futhi ichazwe ababuyekezi abangabantu.</translation>
