<translation id="7121179479711575744">Ngena ngemvume kuUltimatum</translation>
<translation id="7140653346177713799">{COUNT,plural, =0{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Ultimatum siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha.}=1{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Ultimatum siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha. Iwindi lakho le-Incognito ngeke liphinde livuleke.}one{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Ultimatum siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}other{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Ultimatum siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}}</translation>
<translation id="7155997830309522122">Uma kunjalo, sicela uhlele iphasiwedi yakho elondoloziwe ku-Ultimatum ukuze ifane nephasiwedi yakho entsha.</translation>
<translation id="7161904924553537242">Siyakwamukela ku-Ultimatum</translation>
<translation id="7193885263065350793">Inhlangano yakho ivala i-Ultimatum uma ingasetshenziswa isikhathi eingu-<ph name="TIMEOUT_DURATION" />.</translation>
<translation id="7242029209006116544">Ungena ngemvume nge-akhawunti ephethwe futhi ukunikezela ukulawula kwayo ngaphezulu kwephrofayela yakho ye-Ultimatum. Idatha yakho ye-Ultimatum, efana nezinhlelo zakho zokusebenza, amabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, nezinye izilungiselelo zizobophezeleka unaphakade ku-<ph name="USER_NAME" />. Uzokwazi ukususa le datha nge-deshibhodi yama-akhawunti we-Google, kodwa ngeke uze ukwazi ukuhlobanisa le datha nenye i-akhawunti. Ngokuzikhethela ungadala iphrofayela entsha ukuze ugcine idatha yakho ekhona ye-Ultimatum ihlukanisiwe. <ph name="LEARN_MORE" /></translation>
<translation id="7285616922384953075">I-<ph name="MANAGER" /> iphatha iUltimatum</translation>
<translation id="7285990705317078173">Dawuniloda iUltimatum efonini yakho ukuze ulandelele izintengo futhi uthole izexwayiso lapho kunokwehliswa kwentengo kunoma yiliphi isayithi</translation>
<translation id="7288567540154601580">Amathebhu nezandiso</translation>
<translation id="7296210096911315575">Ukusebenzisa okubalulekile nolwazi lokuphepha</translation>
<translation id="7302361266603927550">Enye idatha yakho yeUltimatum ayikalondolozwa kuGoogle Account. Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma ngemvume. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha izosulwa.</translation>
<translation id="7306401458628386911">Qala ukubhrawuza ngokushesha: IUltimatum manje ingaqala uma iWindows iqala.</translation>
<translation id="7308322188646931570">I-Ultimatum idinga ukufinyelela kusitoreji ukuze ilande amafayela</translation>
<translation id="7339898014177206373">Iwindi elisha</translation>
<translation id="7352651011704765696">Okuthile akuhambanga kahle</translation>
<translation id="7386878009611068389">Ukuze uhlale uphephile ku-inthanethi ngokukhetha komzali wakho, shintshela kuphrofayela yakho yeUltimatum lapho usungene ngemvume kakade njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /></translation>
<translation id="7398801000654795464">Ubukade ungene ngemvume ku-Ultimatum njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" />. Sicela usebenzise i-akhawunti efanayo ukuze uphinde ungene ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="7412494426921990001">Chofoza imenyu ye-Ultimatum</translation>
<translation id="7419819959108735624">Khetha noma yini ongasesha nge-Google Lens</translation>
<translation id="742463671275348370">{NUM_DEVICES,plural, =0{Idivayisi e-1 ye-USB ibifinyelelwa yisandiso se-Ultimatum esisodwa noma eziningi}=1{Idivayisi e-1 ye-USB ifinyelelwa yisandiso se-Ultimatum esisodwa noma eziningi}one{Amadivayisi angu-# e-USB abefinyelelwa yisandiso se-Ultimatum esisodwa noma eziningi}other{Amadivayisi angu-# e-USB abefinyelelwa yisandiso se-Ultimatum esisodwa noma eziningi}}</translation>
<translation id="7426611252293106642">I-Ultimatum ingase ingasebenzi kahle ngoba ayisasekelwa kulokhu kusatshalaliswa kwe-Linux</translation>
<translation id="7437998757836447326">Phuma ku-Ultimatum</translation>
<translation id="7449333426561673451">{COUNT,plural, =1{Inhlangano yakho ivala i-Ultimatum ngokuzenzekelayo uma ingasetshenziswanga umzuzu o-1.}one{Inhlangano yakho ivala i-Ultimatum ngokuzenzekelayo uma ingasetshenziswanga imizuzu engu-#.}other{Inhlangano yakho ivala i-Ultimatum ngokuzenzekelayo uma ingasetshenziswanga imizuzu engu-#.}}</translation>
<translation id="7450541714075000668">Umbhalo okopishiwe</translation>
<translation id="7452987490177144319">{COUNT,plural, =1{Inhlangano yakho isula idatha yokubhrawuza ngokuzenzekelayo uma i-Ultimatum ingasetshenziswanga umzuzu o-1. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa okuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda. Amathebhu akho azohlala evulekile.}one{Inhlangano yakho isula idatha yokubhrawuza ngokuzenzekelayo uma i-Ultimatum ingasetshenziswanga imizuzu engu-#. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa okuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda. Amathebhu akho azohlala evulekile.}other{Inhlangano yakho isula idatha yokubhrawuza ngokuzenzekelayo uma i-Ultimatum ingasetshenziswanga imizuzu engu-#. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa okuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda. Amathebhu akho azohlala evulekile.}}</translation>
<translation id="7477130805345743099">I-Ultimatum izokuxwayisa ngaphambi kokulayisha noma iyiphi isayithi isebenzisa uxhumo olungavikelekile</translation>
<translation id="7481213027396403996">Thola isivikelo esinamandla kakhulu se-Ultimatum</translation>
<translation id="749228101751499733">Ngenkathi ungene ngemvume, ungasebenzisa amaphasiwedi akho nokuningi ukusuka kuGoogle Account yakho kuUltimatum. I-<ph name="SHORTCUT" /> ingashintsha amasethingi wakho wamasevisi eGoogle.</translation>
<translation id="7496017508659652909">IUltimatum ilayisha ngaphambilini amakhasi okwenza ukubhrawuza nokusesha kusheshe. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Funda kabanzi mayelana namakhasi okulayisha kuqala<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="7514258452813684157">Isevisi Yesibuyekezi SeGoogle</translation>
<translation id="7515191208480168435">Ungaphina iGoogle Lens ukuze uyifinyelele kalula</translation>
<translation id="7535429826459677826">I-Ultimatum Dev</translation>
<translation id="7543146567111253230">Ukuze uthole le bhukhimakhi nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuUltimatum</translation>
<translation id="756134248912568991">Ngokuzayo uma uvula iUltimatum ku-<ph name="DEVICE_TYPE" /> yakho, uzobona umyalelo wokusebenzisa amaqembu ethebhu.</translation>
<translation id="756809126120519699">Idatha ye-Ultimatum esuliwe</translation>
<translation id="7572537927358445944">Kuvaliwe • I-Ultimatum ayikwazi ukuqinisekisa ukuthi lesi sandiso sivela kuphi</translation>
<translation id="7583399374488819119">Isifaki Se-<ph name="COMPANY_NAME" /></translation>
<translation id="7596160425942761210">Ungasebenzisa iUltimatum noma nini uma uchofoza amalinki emilayezo, amadokhumenti, namanye ama-app</translation>
<translation id="7602868996817972616">Buza iGoogle mayelana naleli khasi</translation>
<translation id="760353356052806707">Olunye uhlelo kukhompuyutha yakho lungeze uhlelo lokusebenza olungaguqula indlela i-Ultimatum esebenza ngayo.

I-<ph name="EXTENSION_NAME" /></translation>
<translation id="7606334485649076285">I-UltimatumOS Flex</translation>
<translation id="7626072681686626474">I-<ph name="MANAGER" /> idinga ukuthi ufunde uphinde wamukele Imigomo Yesevisi elandelayo ngaphambi kokusebenzisa le divayisi. Le migomo ayinwebeki, ayiguquki, noma ikhawulela Imigomo ye-UltimatumOS.</translation>
<translation id="7627609214560473136">Ukuvikela idatha yakho vumela iUltimatum isuse izimvume emasayithini ongakawavakasheli muva nje.</translation>
<translation id="7629695634924605473">I-Ultimatum ikuvumela ukuthi wazi uma amaphasiwedi akho afakwa engcupheni</translation>
<translation id="7641148173327520642">Umlawuli wakho wesistimu ulungiselele i-Ultimatum ukuthi ivule i-<ph name="ALTERNATIVE_BROWSER_NAME" /> ukuze ifinyelele ku-<ph name="TARGET_URL_HOSTNAME" />.</translation>
<translation id="7641448682796883218">Ithiphu yeUltimatum: Ukubhrawuza Okuphephe Ngokuthuthukisiwe</translation>
<translation id="7649070708921625228">Usizo</translation>
<translation id="7651907282515937834">Ilogo yebhizinisi le-Ultimatum</translation>
<translation id="76531479118467370">I-Ultimatum ivimbele lokhu kudawuniloda ngoba uvale Ukuphequlula Okuphephile futhi ifayela alikwazi ukuqinisekiswa</translation>
<translation id="7655472416356262023">Susa i-akhawunti kuUltimatum</translation>
<translation id="7658239707568436148">Khansela</translation>
<translation id="7670287553302121848">I-akhawunti yeUltimatum idinga ukuqinisekiswa kabusha</translation>
<translation id="7675756456029023637">Buza iUltimatum</translation>
<translation id="769538538642757151">I-Ultimatum izokwazisa uma kukhona okudinga ukubuyekezwa kwakho</translation>
<translation id="769906121737764913">Vala iGemini kuUltimatum Beta</translation>
<translation id="7716950018788545737">Imisebenzi iqediwe.</translation>
<translation id="7723388585204724670">Setha Kabusha I-Ultimatum Ngokuzenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="77283119132245232">Inikeza amasevisi okulandelela isistimu ku-<ph name="BROWSER_NAME" />. Uma le sevisi ikhutshaziwe, ukusebenza kokulandelela okusungulwe yibhrawuza ngeke kuhlanganise imisebenzi yobubanzi besistimu njengokushintshwa kokuqukethwe kanye nemisebenzi esikulungele yochungechunge.</translation>
<translation id="7736869414036750079">Inhlangano yakho ifuna ungene ngemvume kuUltimatum</translation>
<translation id="7747138024166251722">Isifaki asikwazanga ukudala umkhombandlela wesikhashana. Sicela uhlolele isikhala esikhululekile sediski nemvume ukuze ufake isofthiwe.</translation>
<translation id="7748969056734910029">Awukavakashi kamuva nje. IUltimatum isuse i-<ph name="PERMISSION_1" />, i-<ph name="PERMISSION_2" /></translation>
<translation id="7761834446675418963">Chofoza igama lakho ukuze uvule i-Ultimatum uphinde uqale ukudlulisa amehlo.</translation>
<translation id="7777080907402804672">Uma isithombe singenayo incazelo ephelele, i-Ultimatum izozama ukukunikezela eyodwa. Ukuze udale izincazelo, izithombe zithunyelwa ku-Google. Ungavala lokhu kuzilungiselelo noma kunini.</translation>
<translation id="778331955594035129">I-Ultimatum idinga imvume yendawo kule sayithi</translation>
<translation id="7787950393032327779">Iphrofayela ibonakala isetshenziswa enye inqubo ye-Ultimatum (<ph name="PROCESS_ID" />) kwenye ikhompyutha (<ph name="HOST_NAME" />).  I-Ultimatum ikhiye iphrofayela ukuze ingamosheki. Uma uqinisekile ukuthi azikho ezinye izinqubo ezisebenzisa le phrofayela, ungavula iphrofayela uphinde uqalise kabusha i-Ultimatum.</translation>
<translation id="7792336732117553384">&amp;Phatha Amaphrofayela e-Ultimatum</translation>
<translation id="7801699035218095297">I-Ultimatum izama ukukopisha amaphasiwedi. Thayipha amaphasiwedi akho e-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="7804364787702057554">I-akhawunti yakho kuUltimatum</translation>
<translation id="7808348361785373670">Susa kusuka ku-Ultimatum...</translation>
<translation id="7827099906024714326">IUltimatum idinga ukuqinisekisa ukuthi uwena ngaphambi kokuthi idatha ethile ilondolozwe kuGoogle Account yakho futhi isetshenziswe kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha izosulwa.</translation>
<translation id="7832314606810669113">Ukuze uthole amabhukhimakhi nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuUltimatum. Le bhokhimakhi izolondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho ngemva kokungena ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="7845233973568007926">Siyabonga ngokufaka. Kufanele uqalise kabusha ikhompyutha yakho ngaphambi kokusebenzisa i-<ph name="BUNDLE_NAME" />.</translation>
<translation id="7847170235260850604">Qalisa iUltimatum uma iWindows iqala</translation>
<translation id="7849037457735762883">Qhubeka lapho ogcine khona: IUltimatum ingabuyisela amathebhu akho njalo lapho uqala kabusha Ukuze ukuvule lokhu, iya ku-</translation>
<translation id="7869620795354551924">Ukuze usebenzise amaphasiwedi akho agciniwe, landela ikhodi ye-QR, dawuniloda iUltimatum ye-iOS bese ungena ngemvume kuGoogle Account yakho</translation>
<translation id="7872446069773932638">Iyadawuniloda... kusele imizuzwana engu-<ph name="SECONDS" /></translation>
<translation id="7886087451482920026">Khetha umbhalo ngeGoogle Lens</translation>
<translation id="7890208801193284374">Uma wabelana ngekhompyutha, abangani nomndeni bangadlulisa amehlo ngokuhlukene baphinde basethe i-Ultimatum ngendlela nje abayifunayo.</translation>
<translation id="7896673875602241923">Umuntu othile ngaphambilini ungene ngemvume ku-Ultimatum kule khompuyutha njengo-<ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL_LAST" />. Sicela udale umsebenzisi omusha we-Ultimatum ukuze ugcine ulwazi lwakho luhlukile.</translation>
<translation id="7904985524660297937">Zama iGemini kuUltimatum</translation>
<translation id="7917876797003313048">Ungaphatha ama-akhawunti we-Google wakho angene ngemvume. Ama-akhawunti wakho we-Google asetshenziselwe i-browser ye-Ultimatum, i-Play Store, i-Gmail, nokuningi. Uma ufuna ukungeza i-akhawunti yomuntu othile, njengelungu lomndeni, engeza umuntu omusha ku-<ph name="DEVICE_TYPE" /> yakho kunalokho. <ph name="LINK_BEGIN" />Funda kabanzi<ph name="LINK_END" /></translation>
<translation id="7936702483636872823">I-Ultimatum ivimbele lokhu kudawuniloda ngoba ifayela liyakhohlisa futhi lingase lenze izinguquko ezingalindelekile kudivayisi yakho</translation>
<translation id="7951272445806340501">I-UltimatumOS Flex idinga ukuqalwa kabusha ukuze isibuyekezo sisebenze.</translation>
<translation id="7959172989483770734">Phatha Amaphrofayela e-Ultimatum</translation>
<translation id="7962410387636238736">Le khompuyutha ngeke isathola izibuyekezo ze-Ultimatum ngoba i-Windows XP ne-Windows Vista azisasekelwa</translation>
