<translation id="8009904340233602924">Sebenzisa i-Ultimatum ngaphandle kwe-akhawunti</translation>
<translation id="8010081455002666927">Thola ngokuzenzakalela</translation>
<translation id="8013993649590906847">Uma isithombe singenayo incazelo ephelele, i-Ultimatum izozama ukukunikezela eyodwa. Ukuze udale izincazelo, izithombe zithunyelwa ku-Google.</translation>
<translation id="8019103195866286235">Lesi sandiso sisuswe ukushicilela ngunjiniyela waso, futhi kungenzeka sibe esingaphephile. Sisuse ku-Ultimatum ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="8040768861829554732">Isandiso sifuna ukuthi ungene kuUltimatum</translation>
<translation id="8041795619940733262">Buza iGoogle<ph name="LINE_BREAK" />mayelana nale thebhu</translation>
<translation id="80471789339884597">Siyabonga ngokufaka. Kufanele uqalise kabusha wonke amabhrawuza akho ngaphambi kokusebenzisa i-<ph name="BUNDLE_NAME" />.</translation>
<translation id="8064015586118426197">I-UltimatumOS Flex</translation>
<translation id="8064965390968184078">1. Chofoza okuthi <ph name="BUTTON_LABEL" /> ngezansi
2. Chofoza okuthi <ph name="BUTTON_2" /> kumasethingi akho eWindows
3. Chofoza okuthi <ph name="BUTTON_3" /> esazisweni seWindows ukuze uphine iUltimatum kubha yakho yomsebenzi ukuze ufinyelele ngokushesha</translation>
<translation id="8074398340364918139">Ukuze useshe isakhi noma isandiso esithile seUltimatum, thayipha isinqamuleli sayo kubha yekheli, kulandelwe inkinobho yekhibhodi oyikhethile</translation>
<translation id="8077579734294125741">Amanye Amaphrofayili e-Ultimatum</translation>
<translation id="8086881907087796310">Ukufakwa kwehlulekile ngenxa yokuthi ikhompyutha yakho ayihlangabezani nezimfuneko zenani elincane lehadiwe.</translation>
<translation id="8113883687556086139">Qinisekisa ukuthi nguwe ukuze usebenzise futhi ulondoloze idatha yeUltimatum ku-akhawunti yakho, <ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL" /></translation>
<translation id="8115695070094288807">Yenza iUltimatum ibe ngeyakho...</translation>
<translation id="8118331347066725040">Thumela impendulo yokusesha nge-Lens</translation>
<translation id="8129812357326543296">Mayelana ne-Ultimatum</translation>
<translation id="813913629614996137">Iyaqalisa...</translation>
<translation id="8162006532256575008">Sebenzisa i-Ultimatum Ngaphandle kwe-Akhawunti</translation>
<translation id="8172231188687329735">Thola i-app yeUltimatum ukuze ulondoloze amaphasiwedi usendleleni</translation>
<translation id="8177472873527554730">Asikwazi ukuthola ikhontenti kuleli khasi</translation>
<translation id="8221491193165283816">Uvamise ukuvimba izaziso. Ukuze uvumele leli sayithi ukuthi likwazise, chofoza lapha.</translation>
<translation id="8253851811470049684">Vula amalinki kuUltimatum kunoma iyiphi i-app futhi ugcine ibhrawuza ifinyeleleka ku-taskbar yakho</translation>
<translation id="8255190535488645436">I-Ultimatum isebenzisa ikhamela yakho nemakrofoni.</translation>
<translation id="8267953129876836456">Uma ivuliwe, i-Ultimatum ilayisha kuqala amakhasi okwenza ukuphequlula nokusesha kusheshe.</translation>
<translation id="8286862437124483331">I-Ultimatum izama ukubonisa amaphasiwedi. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="829923460755755423">Engeza isinqamuleli Kumphathi Wephasiwedi Ye-Google</translation>
<translation id="8313851650939857356">Iphutha ekuqaliseni: <ph name="STARTUP_ERROR" />.</translation>
<translation id="8321888067342493336">Londoloza njengesithombe</translation>
<translation id="8336463659890584292">Lapho isayithi icela ukulayisha kusengaphambili ngasese amalinki ekhasini layo, i-Ultimatum isebenzisa amaseva e-Google. Lokhu kusiza umazisi wakho kusayithi elayishwe ngaphambilini, kodwa i-Google ifunda ukuthi yimaphi amasayithi alayishwa ngaphambilini.</translation>
<translation id="8342675569599923794">Leli fayela liyingozi, ngakho-ke i-Ultimatum ilivimbile.</translation>
