<translation id="8377158135256176353">Guqula iGemini kuUltimatum Canary</translation>
<translation id="8387459386171870978">Qhubeka nokusebenzisa i-Ultimatum</translation>
<translation id="8394720698884623075">Kuhlola ama-URL anohlu lwamasayithi angaphephile agcinwe ku-Ultimatum</translation>
<translation id="8403038600646341038">Ilogo ye-Ultimatum ngaphakathi kwesikrini sekhompyutha.</translation>
<translation id="8418845734693287262">I-UltimatumOS ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngoba imininingwane yokungena ngemvume kwe-akhawunti yakho akusisesikhathini.</translation>
<translation id="842386925677997438">Amathuluzi okuphepha e-Ultimatum</translation>
<translation id="8425765582779547329">Ukuze uhlale uphephile ku-inthanethi ngokukhethwayo komzali wakho, ngena ngemvume kuUltimatum</translation>
<translation id="842852285618875960">Ufinyelele umkhawulo wamabhukhimakhi angu-<ph name="BOOKMARK_LIMIT" /> weUltimatum, ngakho amanye amabhukhimakhi akho awakalondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho okwamanje.

Amabhukhimakhi amasha awakwazi ukulondolozwa e-akhawuntini yakho uze usule amanye. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, amabhukhimakhi angalondoloziwe azosulwa.</translation>
<translation id="8433638294851456451">Ukuze uthumele inombolo kusukela lapha kufoni yakho ye-Android, ngena ngemvume ku-Ultimatum kuwo womabili amadivayisi.</translation>
<translation id="8458117863387545390">Thola iUltimatum efonini yakho</translation>
<translation id="8496177819998570653">I-Google P&amp;assword Manager</translation>
<translation id="8498858610309223613">Isibuyekezo esibalulekile sokuvikela se-Ultimatum sisanda kusetshenziswa. Qalisa kabusha manje bese sizobuyisela amathebhu akho.</translation>
